t 12, the record for Carroll County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 51% of normal in October to November and 50% in November to December. Every one of the 7 grids had its driest year in 1963, with grid 20296 at 67% and grids 19998 and 20298 at 62%.</p>"}
